 Keys                                                                               F1 or Esc close

  Move                                             Hunks
  j k        line down, up                         J K        next, previous
  Ctrl-d u   half page                             ]c [c      next, previous
  gg G       top, bottom                           >          copy to right
  ← →        scroll sideways                       <          copy to left
  Tab        other pane                            u          undo
                                                   Ctrl-r     redo
  Search
  / ?        forward, back                         View
  n N        next, previous                        v          side by side, unified
  Esc        clear matches                         W          whitespace mode

  Files
  w          save
  e          open in $EDITOR
  q          quit
  Q          quit, don't save
 1/4   whitespace off  LF | LF
